+## Check frozen effort settings
+
+Before recording benchmark runs, check the lane efforts against a specific settings
+file without changing it. Pass one or more `lane=value` expectations by repeating
+`--expect`:
+
+```sh
+python3 plugins/astral-orchestrator/scripts/configure-effort.py \
+  --settings-file /path/to/effort-levels.toml \
+  --check \
+  --expect orchestrator=high \
+  --expect luna=xhigh \
+  --json
+```
+
+Check mode is read-only: it never creates or rewrites the supplied settings file. It
+prints JSON with the effective efforts, requested expectations, any mismatches, and a
+`matched` boolean. The command exits zero only when every expectation matches; any
+mismatch exits non-zero. If the file does not exist, the effective defaults are checked
+and `settings_file_present` is false.
+
